at the Power Plant\\nis broken, and we’re not receiving\\felectricity!\\rI don’t know how long it will be until\\nwe can get the Magnet Train going.","msg_0535_T11R0601_00001":"Thanks to someone who got the\\nPower Plant up and running,\\fthe Magnet Train is available again!\\rPassengers need to go through the\\ngate for the automatic ticket check...\\r","msg_0535_T11R0601_00002":"...Beep!\\rI am so sorry, but you need\\na Magnet Train Pass to get on\\fthe Magnet Train...\\r","msg_0535_T11R0601_00003":"Passengers need to go through the\\ngate for the automatic ticket check...\\r","msg_0535_T11R0601_00004":"Ping...fwip!\\nHere is your Pass back.\\rThis train is about to leave\\nfor Goldenrod City.","msg_0535_T11R0601_00005":"Enjoy the attractive and magnetic\\njourney!","msg_0535_T11R0601_00006":"We have arrived at Saffron! Saffron!\\nThe accent is on the “a”!","msg_0535_T11R0601_00007":"Enjoy the attractive and magnetic\\njourney!\\r","msg_0535_T11R0601_00008":"The Magnet Train is a super-modern\\nrail liner that uses electricity and\\fmagnets to attain incredible speeds.\\rHowever, there isn’t any electricity.\\nIt’s just an iron box.","msg_0535_T11R0601_00009":"Whew...\\rHow many times have I gone back\\nand forth between Kanto and Johto?","msg_0535_T11R0601_00010":"Before the Magnet Train station was\\nbuilt, there was a house here.\\rA little girl who was called Copycat\\nused to live in it.","msg_0535_T11R0601_00011":"Hi. Do you have a Magnet Train Pass?\\rI have one.\\rAll the people in Saffron who ride the\\nMagnet Train have Passes.","msg_0535_T11R0601_00012":"Lt. Surge: Oh! I never expected to see\\nyou at a place like this!\\fWhat a coincidence!\\rI can feel great electric power around\\nthe Magnet Train station!\\rYou had a PIKACHU, didn’t you?\\nHow about trading it for my\\fFrench PIKACHU? {YESNO 0}","msg_0535_T11R0601_00013":"Lt. Surge: My PIKACHU and\\nyour PIKACHU up for a trade,\\fwhat do you think?","msg_0535_T11R0601_00014":"Lt. Surge: Wow! Electrifying!\\nLet’s trade ’em now!\\r","msg_0535_T11R0601_00015":"Lt. Surge: Shocking!\\nI want to share my feelings for\\fPIKACHU with you!\\rI’m ready anytime, so just bring\\na PIKACHU, OK?","msg_0535_T11R0601_00016":"Lt. Surge: Yeah!\\nI’m so ecstatic! I’ll see you around.\\fGood-bye!\\r","msg_0535_T11R0601_00017":"Lt. Surge: What? That is not\\nthe right Pokémon!\\rI won’t trade my PIKACHU for\\nanything other than PIKACHU.","msg_0535_T11R0601_00018":"We request that you make sure your\\nPokémon are well behaved or put away\\fin their Poké Balls so they won’t lick\\fother passengers’ faces.\\fThank you."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnResume":"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_005 + 1","OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_006 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T11R0601_008":8,"obj_T11R0601_policeman":0,"obj_T11R0601_gsbigman":1,"obj_T11R0601_gswoman1":2,"obj_T11R0601_gsgirl1":3,"obj_T11R0601_gsleader9":4}}
